{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/4/854226980e2579f6005af75323d5e102d738fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6545$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> can be written as a product of a pair of positive two-digit numbers.  What is the sum of this pair of numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/9/c8970299ab83339aa6a369ccd20cdf5a04ba2ee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 162 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 172 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 173 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 174 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/4/854226980e2579f6005af75323d5e102d738fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6545$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf9b2e3b727136bcc413e08cafbb32278c4d1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot7\\cdot11\\cdot17  =385\\cdot17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"179\" height=\"14\" />, which contains a three digit number, but we want 6545 to be expressed as ab x cd. Now we do trial and error: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f48648c74e82941d47b152c169d0d03ad23af3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5\\cdot7=35 \\text{,   } 11\\cdot17=187 \\text{  X}\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a64bdea4f1a7a518b33456552c44ecbb468e8bab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5\\cdot11=55 \\text{,   } 7\\cdot17=119 \\text{  X}\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/1/361ca82bfea52e6778ac6f3687c2611976a7b2bf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5\\cdot17=85 \\text{,   } 7\\cdot11=77 \\text{ }\\surd\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18f0ea8ccfec284b6d0dff917a81759af971833c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[85+77= \\boxed{\\text{(A)}\\ 162}\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbd3790589cb7959b379e9e4887fc0a8e8197c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6545 = 6561 - 16 = 81^2 - 4^2 = (81 - 4)(81 + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"379\" height=\"21\" />. Thus, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd220324b3680505c669bca4a8c8a1b3382a493.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(81 - 4) + (81 + 4) = 2 \\times 81 = \\boxed{\\text{(A)}\\ 162}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"319\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p><p>This solution is motivated by noticing that a large perfect square, 6561, is close to 6545. In fact, this number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387be85c97b527ddd652f307ed502f32ad0c79c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^8$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, which makes it easily recognized.\n</p><p>- GaloisTorrent\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the numbers, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/3/89387635336378955301fa3c396847bd5fa5b10c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/f/49f7b78ac947099df42886cdb98c6195323fc97d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 6545$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> is odd, both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are odd.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8603e577fd95b3b0d56c11aa45cadc8a711667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y &lt; 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09d6896886b8d801df92eb2976bf03c59ae71815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{6545}{100} = 65.45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"142\" height=\"38\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07dd96286f0ceac95429317faac6083592865543.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$66 \\leq x, y \\leq 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/4/854226980e2579f6005af75323d5e102d738fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6545$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/7/e0751348898a7b923f6a0cf36abbce2a1181319a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{75, 85, 95\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" />.  The only divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/4/854226980e2579f6005af75323d5e102d738fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6545$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> in this set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fea07b9bf739f8e420081f31186264b91ced2ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/694cdfee204bdb0e2d6a758e22a1701d7d032677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6545 \\div 85 = 77$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/8710d5cf5da1b6d4ec4a61ce888172cad105bb61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 77$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3838ab81b08150274d6e07ff821a63ee91154689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/4/0442b6d8e7df91b30b09e8723693ac2ffc838a92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 162}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"142\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185201\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 228/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1967/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6121/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.915      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n100.00%    6.915      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10158:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185201 and revision id 285450. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}